{
  "name": "RAN · Signup Access",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ran/signup-access",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-signup",
      "name": "Webhook signup-access",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 360],
      "webhookId": "ran-signup-access"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}",
                    "rightValue": "access_requested",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "requested"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}",
                    "rightValue": "access_approved",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "approved"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}",
                    "rightValue": "access_rejected",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "rejected"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "switch-event",
      "name": "Type événement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [520, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p1",
              "name": "event",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.event ?? $json.event }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p2",
              "name": "user_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.user_id ?? $json.user_id }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "p3",
              "name": "full_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.full_name ?? $json.full_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p4",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.email ?? $json.email }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p5",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.phone ?? $json.phone }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p6",
              "name": "job_profile",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.job_profile ?? $json.job_profile }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p7",
              "name": "department",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.department ?? $json.department }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p8",
              "name": "employee_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.employee_id ?? $json.employee_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p9",
              "name": "admin_email",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.admin_email ?? $json.admin_email ?? $env.ADMIN_EMAIL }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p10",
              "name": "admin_panel_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.admin_panel_url ?? $json.admin_panel_url ?? 'http://localhost:3000/admin/users' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p11",
              "name": "login_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.login_url ?? $json.login_url ?? 'http://localhost:3000/login' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "normalize-payload",
      "name": "Normaliser payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [760, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.RAN_SMTP_FROM || 'ran-noc@ooredoo.tn' }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.admin_email }}",
        "subject": "=RAN Intelligence — Demande d'accès · {{ $json.full_name }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<h2>Nouvelle demande d'accès</h2><p><strong>{{ $json.full_name }}</strong> souhaite rejoindre RAN Intelligence.</p><ul><li>Email : {{ $json.email }}</li><li>Téléphone : {{ $json.phone }}</li><li>Profil : {{ $json.job_profile }}</li><li>Département : {{ $json.department || '—' }}</li><li>Matricule : {{ $json.employee_id || '—' }}</li></ul><p><a href=\"{{ $json.admin_panel_url }}\">Ouvrir Admin → Utilisateurs</a></p><p><em>Accepter ou refuser depuis la fiche utilisateur.</em></p>"
      },
      "id": "email-admin",
      "name": "Email admin (demande)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1040, 180],
      "notes": "Brancher credential SMTP (Mailtrap / Ooredoo). Le backend envoie déjà l'email — ce nœud sert de relais Teams/Slack ou doublon."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.RAN_SMTP_FROM || 'ran-noc@ooredoo.tn' }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=RAN Intelligence — Accès approuvé",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<p>Bonjour <strong>{{ $json.full_name }}</strong>,</p><p>Votre demande d'accès a été <strong>approuvée</strong>.</p><p><a href=\"{{ $json.login_url }}\">Se connecter à RAN Intelligence</a></p>"
      },
      "id": "email-user-approved",
      "name": "Email user (approuvé)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1040, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.RAN_SMTP_FROM || 'ran-noc@ooredoo.tn' }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=RAN Intelligence — Demande non approuvée",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<p>Bonjour <strong>{{ $json.full_name }}</strong>,</p><p>Votre demande d'accès n'a pas été approuvée. Contactez votre administrateur réseau.</p>"
      },
      "id": "email-user-rejected",
      "name": "Email user (refusé)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1040, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAN · Signup Access\n\n**Webhook** : `POST /webhook/ran/signup-access`\n\nÉvénements émis par le backend :\n- `access_requested` — inscription publique (/signup)\n- `access_approved` — admin clique « Accepter »\n- `access_rejected` — admin clique « Refuser »\n\n**Env (.env.auth)** :\n`N8N_ENABLED=true`\n`N8N_WEBHOOK_SIGNUP_ACCESS=http://localhost:5678/webhook/ran/signup-access`\n\n**Variables n8n** : `RAN_API_TOKEN`, `ADMIN_EMAIL`, `RAN_SMTP_FROM`\n\nBrancher **SMTP** sur les 3 nœuds Email (ou remplacer par Teams/Slack).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "note-setup",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook signup-access": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Normaliser payload", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Normaliser payload": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Type événement", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Type événement": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Email admin (demande)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Email user (approuvé)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Email user (refusé)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
